flowchart TB
  Tenant[Tenant] --> GetEntitlements[GET /subscriptions/entitlements]
  GetEntitlements --> Plan[Plan + limits + overrides + usage]
  Admin[Admin] --> Preview[POST .../preview-change]
  Preview --> WillExceed[willExceed, featureDiff]
  Admin --> PATCH[PATCH .../subscriptions/:id]
  PATCH --> Check{Usage vs target plan?}
  Check -->|exceeds & !force| Block[400 LIMIT_EXCEEDED]
  Check -->|ok or force+reason| Update[Update subscription]
  PATCH --> ApplyAtEnd[applyAtPeriodEnd?\npending_plan_id, pending_effective_at]
  Update --> ChangeLog[subscription_change_log]
  GetEntitlements --> ApplyPending{pending_effective_at <= now?}
  ApplyPending -->|yes| ApplyPlan[Apply pending plan]
